This licence covers the source code in this repository.

It does not cover the input data. The hospital discharge records are published
as open government data by the National Health Fund (FONASA) of Chile, the
socio-economic indicators come from the CASEN 2022 survey (Ministry of Social
Development and Family) and the structural indicators come from the 2024
Population and Housing Census (National Institute of Statistics). Each of those
sources carries its own terms of use, and users are responsible for complying
with them.
